{"id":"70e6aa2f33c624e8","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-harmonic.md","title":"Harmonic","display":"df-harmonic — Harmonic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-harmonic","aliases":["58-df-harmonic"],"display":"df-harmonic — Harmonic","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-harmonic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-harmonic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-harmonic — Harmonic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span> 为开集</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in C^2(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\">\\(u\\in C^2(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_n(x,y)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\sum_{j=1}^n|x_j-y_j|^2\\bigr)^{1/2}\">\\(d_n(x,y)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\sum_{j=1}^n|x_j-y_j|^2\\bigr)^{1/2}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{d_n}(x,r)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^n:d_n(x,y)&lt;r\\}\">\\(B_{d_n}(x,r)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^n:d_n(x,y)&lt;r\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial_j^2u\">\\(\\partial_j^2u\\)</span>（第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个坐标的二阶偏导）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta u\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=1}^n\\partial_j^2u\">\\(\\Delta u\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=1}^n\\partial_j^2u\\)</span>（Laplacian）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Harmonic}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Harmonic}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（此处定义的调和函数谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}harmonic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Harmonic}_S(u,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(B_{d_n}(x,r)\\subseteq\\Omega)\\bigr)\\land u\\in C^2(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(\\Delta u(x)=0)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}harmonic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Harmonic}_S(u,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(B_{d_n}(x,r)\\subseteq\\Omega)\\bigr)\\land u\\in C^2(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(\\Delta u(x)=0)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Harmonic functions solve Laplace's equation.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^2\">\\(C^2\\)</span> 正则性确保逐点 Laplacian 有定义；弱调和函数需另用分布导数定义。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in C^2(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"d_n(x,y)\\coloneqq\\bigl(\\sum_{j=1}^n|x_j-y_j|^2\\bigr)^{1/2}","display":false},{"tex":"B_{d_n}(x,r)\\coloneqq\\{y\\in\\mathbb R^n:d_n(x,y)<r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial_j^2u","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta u\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=1}^n\\partial_j^2u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Harmonic}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}harmonic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Harmonic}_S(u,\\Omega,n)\\leftrightarrow n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\land\\bigl(\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;(B_{d_n}(x,r)\\subseteq\\Omega)\\bigr)\\land u\\in C^2(\\Omega,\\mathbb R)\\land\\forall x\\in\\Omega\\;(\\Delta u(x)=0)","display":true},{"tex":"C^2","display":false}],"bytes":1145,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-607","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-harmonic.md|58-df-harmonic]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}